[[6,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on a lift.</p><p>Disconnect the connection for the detonation\nsensor located at the side of the air intake chamber.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Detonation sensor - 1</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236577\">K50</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Raise the car.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237705\">1076B50</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolt fixing the detonation sensor and remove it complete\nwith wiring and connection.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018656.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[6,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Tighten the bolt fixing the detonation\nsensor complete with wiring and connection.</p><p><a href=\"#/3237705\">1076B50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a></p><p>Lower the vehicle.</p><p>Connect the connection for the detonation\nsensor at the side of the  intake chamber.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Detonation sensor - 1</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236577\">K50</a></p></td></tr></table></div>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF position, then disconnect the negative battery terminal (-).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235044\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237704\">1076B18</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection for the knock sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Detonation sensor - 1</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236577\">K50</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolt (2a) and remove the knock sensor (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018657.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Place the detonation sensor (1a) in its seating and secure it\ntightening the bolt (1b) to the specified torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>KNOCK SENSOR</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Engine crankcase side) 2.3 ÷ 2.8</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Connect the electrical connection for the knock sensor.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018658.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237704\">1076B18</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]